{"overview":"دو مرد زندانی عهد می بندند که پس از چند سال، از طریق رفتار مناسب با عرف، به آرامش و رهایی نهایی دست یابند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Imprisoned in the 1940s for the double murder of his wife and her lover, upstanding banker Andy Dufresne begins a new life at the Shawshank prison, where he puts his accounting skills to work for an amoral warden. During his long stretch in prison, Dufresne comes to be admired by the other inmates -- including an older prisoner named Red -- for his integrity and unquenchable sense of hope.","tagline_en":"Fear can hold you prisoner. Hope can set you free.","runtime":142,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["فرانک دارابونت"],"crew_en":["Frank Darabont"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"تیم رابینز","role":"Andy Dufresne","photo":"/3FfJMIVwXgsIXbAT8ECBSZJAncR.jpg","en":"Tim Robbins"},{"name":"مورگان فریمن","role":"Ellis Boyd 'Red' Redding","photo":"/905k0RFzH0Kd6gx8oSxRdnr6FL.jpg","en":"Morgan Freeman"},{"name":"باب گانتون","role":"Warden Norton","photo":"/ulbVvuBToBN3aCGcV028hwO0MOP.jpg","en":"Bob Gunton"},{"name":"ویلیام سدلر","role":"Heywood","photo":"/rWeb2kjYCA7V9MC9kRwRpm57YoY.jpg","en":"William Sadler"},{"name":"کلنسی براون","role":"Captain Byron T. Hadley","photo":"/1JeBRNG7VS7r64V9lOvej9bZXW5.jpg","en":"Clancy Brown"},{"name":"Gil Bellows","role":"Tommy","photo":"/eCOIv2nSGnWTHdn88NoMyNOKWyR.jpg"},{"name":"James Whitmore","role":"Brooks Hatlen","photo":"/nYMAbkfwFIgKK84vnLoQctI6vHg.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Rolston","role":"Bogs Diamond","photo":"/hcrNRIptYMRXgkJ9k76BlQu6DQp.jpg"},{"name":"جفری دی‌مان","role":"1946 D.A.","photo":"/70bkLdlkBB7x2NztuJAh4pjdyxy.jpg","en":"Jeffrey DeMunn"},{"name":"Larry Brandenburg","role":"Skeet","photo":"/y13c1a4keaLnoTbi3dERwolQXWP.jpg"},{"name":"Neil Giuntoli","role":"Jigger","photo":"/dRFzPIAinOjXbYOqYEax0sGrfTl.jpg"},{"name":"Brian Libby","role":"Floyd","photo":"/sumWxPgIbCpnp1v1exfJWIt43i3.jpg"}],"trailer":"PLl99DlL6b4","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themov